Mix components thoroughly and adjust pH to 7.0 with NaOH.  Distribute the medium into culture vessels under a N<sub>2</sub> gas stream, seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave.  Reduce the medium by the addition of the following solutions (autoclaved under a N<sub>2</sub> gas atmosphere) per liter:  <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 5% Na<sub>2</sub>S&#183;9H<sub>2</sub>O solution                      </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;8.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
